<section class="kos-composition" kos-debug>
  <div class="kos-grid" kos-cols="12">
    ...
  </div>
</section>`}</code></pre>
          <div class="tutorial-callout tutorial-callout--shuiro">
            <strong>What kos-debug reveals:</strong>
